1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,240
Video ya leo inahusu nini? Ni kuhusu chakula cha majira ya joto nchini Japani.

2
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,740
Sehemu ya 1: Furaha ya Kula Someni Inayotiririka / Jinsi ya Kufurahia Nagashi Somen (Noodles Zinazotiririka)

3
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:14,974
Hii ni duka lililoko ndani ya milima, sivyo?

4
00:00:14,997 --> 00:00:18,091
Ina baridi sana, sivyo?

5
00:00:18,114 --> 00:00:21,548
Maji ya mto yana safi sana.

6
00:00:21,571 --> 00:00:26,248
Tazama, kuna mabambu hapa.

7
00:00:26,271 --> 00:00:30,238
Hii ndiyo someni inayotiririka.

8
00:00:30,261 --> 00:00:32,927
Inaonekana kuwa ya kufurahisha.

9
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:36,350
Shikilia uma wingi na subiri.

10
00:00:36,373 --> 00:00:39,445
Aa, someni zinafika!

11
00:00:39,469 --> 00:00:43,127
Eeh, zina mwendo wa haraka sana.

12
00:00:43,151 --> 00:00:47,219
Aa, zimekwenda!

13
00:00:47,243 --> 00:00:51,055
Ni ngumu kuzishika, sivyo?

14
00:00:51,079 --> 00:00:53,212
Subiri kidogo.

15
00:00:53,235 --> 00:00:55,702
Zitafika tena.

16
00:00:55,725 --> 00:00:58,691
Aa, zinafika tena.

17
00:00:58,714 --> 00:01:00,785
Haraka!

18
00:01:00,809 --> 00:01:04,709
Aa, zimekwenda tena!

19
00:01:04,732 --> 00:01:07,622
Fuatilia kwa makini.

20
00:01:07,645 --> 00:01:10,491
Maji yana mwendo wa haraka mno.

21
00:01:10,515 --> 00:01:13,766
Sasa ni zamu yangu kujaribu.

22
00:01:13,790 --> 00:01:15,926
Jitahidi!

23
00:01:15,949 --> 00:01:17,683
Zimefika.

24
00:01:17,706 --> 00:01:20,725
Aa, nimezishika!

25
00:01:20,748 --> 00:01:23,220
Ni nzuri sana!

26
00:01:23,244 --> 00:01:24,982
Una uwezo mkubwa!

27
00:01:25,005 --> 00:01:28,544
Tuvike kwenye supu na tukale.

28
00:01:28,567 --> 00:01:30,967
Zinakuwa tamu sana.

29
00:01:30,990 --> 00:01:34,123
Ninataka kula pia.

30
00:01:34,146 --> 00:01:37,113
Mara inayofuata nitazishika bila shaka.

31
00:01:37,136 --> 00:01:39,269
Zinafika!

32
00:01:39,292 --> 00:01:41,580
Zinafika kutoka upande wa kulia.

33
00:01:41,603 --> 00:01:44,570
Sawa, nimezishika!

34
00:01:44,593 --> 00:01:46,926
Umefanikiwa!

35
00:01:46,949 --> 00:01:49,194
Hongera!

36
00:01:49,217 --> 00:01:51,584
Ninafurahi sana.

37
00:01:51,607 --> 00:01:54,852
Zinakuwa baridi sana na tamu.

38
00:01:54,875 --> 00:01:58,521
Ni ya kufurahisha, basi tutakula kwa wingi.

39
00:01:58,545 --> 00:02:00,345
Ndiyo.

40
00:02:00,368 --> 00:02:03,901
Ningependa ziendelee kutiririka kwa wingi.

41
00:02:03,924 --> 00:02:08,994
Mtu wa duka anajiandaa, basi subiri kidogo.

42
00:02:09,018 --> 00:02:11,109
Sawa.

43
00:02:11,132 --> 00:02:14,332
Shikilia uma wingi na ujiandae.

44
00:02:14,355 --> 00:02:23,364
Skripu ya video ya leo inaweza kupakuliwa kwenye maelezo na kwenye maoni ya juu.

45
00:02:23,364 --> 00:02:24,864
Sehemu ya 2: Jinsi ya Kula Hiyashi Chuka (Ramen Baridi)

46
00:02:24,864 --> 00:02:27,997
Leo kuna joto sana, sivyo?

47
00:02:28,020 --> 00:02:30,053
Ndiyo, ni joto sana.

48
00:02:30,076 --> 00:02:32,495
Nina njaa.

49
00:02:32,519 --> 00:02:36,530
Nimenunua Hiyashi Chuka kwenye duka la karibu.

50
00:02:36,553 --> 00:02:39,003
Hiyashi Chuka?

51
00:02:39,026 --> 00:02:41,360
Inaonekana tamu sana.

52
00:02:41,384 --> 00:02:44,022
Basi, tuanze kula.

53
00:02:44,046 --> 00:02:45,446
Eh?

54
00:02:45,469 --> 00:02:49,402
Kuna vingi ndani ya begi hii, sivyo?

55
00:02:49,425 --> 00:02:52,992
Ndiyo, kuna supu na vitu vingine.

56
00:02:53,015 --> 00:02:55,711
Hii ni maji?

57
00:02:55,734 --> 00:02:59,782
Hiyo ni maji ya kutenganisha tambi.

58
00:02:59,805 --> 00:03:02,475
Unaosha tambi?

59
00:03:02,499 --> 00:03:05,910
Hapana, siiweki.

60
00:03:05,934 --> 00:03:08,341
Unamimina tambini.

61
00:03:08,364 --> 00:03:10,901
Kisha unachanganya.

62
00:03:10,925 --> 00:03:12,725
Ahaa, nimeelewa.

63
00:03:12,748 --> 00:03:15,589
Kwanza unamimina maji, ndiyo?

64
00:03:15,613 --> 00:03:17,089
Ndiyo.

65
00:03:17,112 --> 00:03:20,748
Baada ya hapo, mimina supu.

66
00:03:20,771 --> 00:03:23,304
Nimeimimina supu.

67
00:03:23,327 --> 00:03:26,094
Sasa nifanye nini?

68
00:03:26,117 --> 00:03:29,334
Weka vitu juu ya tambi.

69
00:03:29,358 --> 00:03:32,891
Ham, mayai na tango, ndiyo?

70
00:03:32,914 --> 00:03:35,789
Inaonekana nzuri sana.

71
00:03:35,812 --> 00:03:39,346
Hii ni haradali na mayonesi.

72
00:03:39,369 --> 00:03:42,615
Je, unaweka mayonesi pia?

73
00:03:42,638 --> 00:03:45,205
Weka kadiri unavyopenda.

74
00:03:45,227 --> 00:03:47,724
Mimi nitaweka.

75
00:03:47,748 --> 00:03:51,020
Mimi nitaweka haradali tu.

76
00:03:51,043 --> 00:03:54,686
Kuna mambo mengi ya kufanya kabla ya kula, sivyo?

77
00:03:54,710 --> 00:03:57,127
Ndiyo, kweli.

78
00:03:57,150 --> 00:04:01,165
Inaonekana kama fumbo dogo gumu.

79
00:04:01,189 --> 00:04:04,648
Lakini, sasa tayari.

80
00:04:04,671 --> 00:04:07,604
Hatimae tunaweza kula.

81
00:04:07,627 --> 00:04:09,227
Tunakula.

82
00:04:09,250 --> 00:04:11,650
Ina ladha gani?

83
00:04:11,673 --> 00:04:15,207
Ina asidi sana na ni tamu.

84
00:04:15,230 --> 00:04:17,996
Inafurahisha, sivyo?

85
00:04:18,019 --> 00:04:21,186
Chakula cha kufaa kwa majira ya joto.

86
00:04:21,209 --> 00:04:22,542
Ndiyo.

87
00:04:22,565 --> 00:04:25,299
Ningependa nikula kila siku.

88
00:04:25,322 --> 00:04:29,090
Mara inayofuata tutununue kitu kutoka dukani tofauti.

89
00:04:29,113 --> 00:04:30,805
Sawa, nzuri.

90
00:04:30,829 --> 00:04:33,795
Tukale pamoja tena.

91
00:04:33,818 --> 00:04:40,923
Kiungo cha ukurasa wa kurudia leo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu kinaweza kupatikana hapa. *Ukumbusho: Ukurasa unaweza kufutwa bila tahadhari.

92
00:04:40,923 --> 00:04:42,423
Sehemu ya 3: Kibanda cha Barafu Katika Sherehe ya Majira ya Joto

93
00:04:42,423 --> 00:04:46,096
Sherehe hii ina watu wengi sana, sivyo?

94
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:50,725
Ndiyo, kuna watu wengi.

95
00:04:50,748 --> 00:04:55,282
Kwa sababu ya joto, tununue barafu iliyosagwa.

96
00:04:55,304 --> 00:04:57,238
Sawa, nzuri.

97
00:04:57,261 --> 00:05:00,753
Kuna kibanda huko.

98
00:05:00,776 --> 00:05:03,071
Tazama menyu.

99
00:05:03,095 --> 00:05:06,702
Kuna aina nyingi.

100
00:05:06,725 --> 00:05:10,960
Kuna stroberi, tembele, na limau.

101
00:05:10,984 --> 00:05:15,184
Kule kuna maandishi ya Blue Hawaii.

102
00:05:15,207 --> 00:05:19,854
Blue Hawaii? Ina ladha gani?

103
00:05:19,878 --> 00:05:23,116
Sasa, ni ladha gani hii?

104
00:05:23,139 --> 00:05:25,413
Jaribu kula.

105
00:05:25,436 --> 00:05:27,806
Sijui kabisa.

106
00:05:27,829 --> 00:05:31,163
Mimi nitachagua Blue Hawaii.

107
00:05:31,187 --> 00:05:34,066
Mimi nitachagua stroberi.

108
00:05:34,090 --> 00:05:37,762
Samahani, naomba hii na hii.

109
00:05:37,785 --> 00:05:42,230
Barafu ya rangi ya buluu, inaonekana nzuri sana!

110
00:05:42,254 --> 00:05:46,094
Ndiyo, ni baridi na tamu.

111
00:05:46,117 --> 00:05:48,850
Ina ladha ya nini?

112
00:05:48,873 --> 00:05:51,407
Hmm, ni tamu.

113
00:05:51,430 --> 00:05:54,900
Lakini ina ladha sawa na stroberi.

114
00:05:54,923 --> 00:05:57,292
Aa, kweli?

115
00:05:57,315 --> 00:06:01,370
Jaribu kula Blue Hawaii yangu.

116
00:06:01,394 --> 00:06:04,692
Aa! Ina ladha sawa.

117
00:06:04,716 --> 00:06:10,925
Kweli, siropu za barafu zote zina ladha sawa.

118
00:06:10,948 --> 00:06:13,589
Aa, ni hivyo?

119
00:06:13,613 --> 00:06:16,046
Sisemi kuamini.

120
00:06:16,069 --> 00:06:19,754
Rangi na harufu tu zinatofautiana.

121
00:06:19,778 --> 00:06:22,456
Hii ni ukweli unaoshtua!

122
00:06:22,479 --> 00:06:24,517
Sikuwa najua.

123
00:06:24,540 --> 00:06:29,507
Lakini rangi ya buluu inafaa kwa majira ya joto, si ndiyo?

124
00:06:29,530 --> 00:06:31,343
Ndiyo, ni joto sana.

125
00:06:31,366 --> 00:06:34,600
Inaweka hali ya sherehe.

126
00:06:34,623 --> 00:06:37,656
Ulimi wako umekuwa wa rangi ya buluu?

127
00:06:37,679 --> 00:06:40,325
Aa, kweli?

128
00:06:40,349 --> 00:06:42,949
Hakuna kioo.

129
00:06:42,972 --> 00:06:46,372
Ndiyo, ni buluu sana!

130
00:06:46,395 --> 00:06:48,694
Ni ya kufurahisha!

131
00:06:48,717 --> 00:06:52,493
Ni aibu kidogo, lakini ni furaha.

132
00:06:52,516 --> 00:06:55,954
Imekuwa kumbukumbu nzuri ya majira ya joto.

133
00:06:55,977 --> 00:07:00,247
Ndiyo, nimefurahi kula barafu hii.

134
00:07:00,271 --> 00:07:01,771
Sehemu ya 4: Siku ya Ng'ombe na Jangwani / Unga na Siku ya Ng'ombe wakati wa Majira ya Joto

135
00:07:01,771 --> 00:07:07,269
Watu wengi wanasimama mstari mrefu mbele ya duka hilo.

136
00:07:07,292 --> 00:07:09,067
Ndiyo, kweli.

137
00:07:09,090 --> 00:07:11,325
Duka la nini hili?

138
00:07:11,349 --> 00:07:14,085
Ni duka la unga.

139
00:07:14,108 --> 00:07:16,186
Unga?

140
00:07:16,210 --> 00:07:19,067
Ni samaki wa bei ghali.

141
00:07:19,090 --> 00:07:22,986
Leo ni Siku ya Ng'ombe wakati wa majira ya joto.

142
00:07:23,010 --> 00:07:26,050
Siku ya Ng'ombe wakati wa majira ya joto?

143
00:07:26,073 --> 00:07:27,968
Ni nini hiyo?

144
00:07:27,991 --> 00:07:31,058
Ni siku maalum ya majira ya joto.

145
00:07:31,081 --> 00:07:34,014
Watu wote wanakula unga.

146
00:07:34,037 --> 00:07:37,892
Kwa nini wanakula unga wakati wa majira ya joto?

147
00:07:37,916 --> 00:07:42,449
Kwa sababu unga unakuwezesha kupata nguvu.

148
00:07:42,472 --> 00:07:45,406
Ili ushindwe na joto la majira ya joto.

149
00:07:45,430 --> 00:07:48,004
Ndiyo, ni hivyo.

150
00:07:48,028 --> 00:07:50,828
Ni utamaduni wa kale wa Japani.

151
00:07:50,851 --> 00:07:53,184
Ni ya kufurahisha!

152
00:07:53,207 --> 00:07:56,007
Twende kusimama mstari pia.

153
00:07:56,030 --> 00:07:58,528
Kuna menyu hapa.

154
00:07:58,552 --> 00:08:00,186
Tazama.

155
00:08:00,209 --> 00:08:04,575
Kuna maandishi ya 'Matsu, Take, Ume'.

156
00:08:04,598 --> 00:08:06,435
Haya ni nini?

157
00:08:06,458 --> 00:08:08,992
Inahusu daraja.

158
00:08:09,015 --> 00:08:12,026
Mti wa matsu ndio wa juu zaidi.

159
00:08:12,049 --> 00:08:15,683
Bei ni tofauti kabisa, sivyo?

160
00:08:15,706 --> 00:08:17,985
Kuna tofauti gani?

161
00:08:18,008 --> 00:08:21,842
Kiasi na ukubwa wa ungali ni tofauti.

162
00:08:21,865 --> 00:08:25,718
Mimi nitachagua ume wa bei nafuu zaidi.

163
00:08:25,741 --> 00:08:29,741
Mimi nitakula matsu kwa anasa.

164
00:08:29,764 --> 00:08:31,297
Eeh?

165
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:33,218
Matsu?

166
00:08:33,241 --> 00:08:35,574
Hii ni nzuri sana!

167
00:08:35,597 --> 00:08:40,431
Nimekaa kwa saa moja, nataka nile tele.

168
00:08:40,454 --> 00:08:44,022
Aa, tumepelekwa kwenye meza.

169
00:08:44,045 --> 00:08:47,112
Harufu nzuri inakuja!

170
00:08:47,135 --> 00:08:49,535
Ungali umefika.

171
00:08:49,558 --> 00:08:52,691
Inaonekana kuwa tamu sana.

172
00:08:52,714 --> 00:08:55,647
Ni laini na tamu, sivyo?

173
00:08:55,670 --> 00:08:57,880
Ninaweza kupata nguvu.

174
00:08:57,903 --> 00:09:01,737
Hata ume una ukubwa wa kutosha na ni tamu.

175
00:09:01,760 --> 00:09:04,993
Lakini ladha ya mchuzi ni nzuri kabisa!

176
00:09:05,016 --> 00:09:07,694
Hii inanifanya nile chakula zaidi.

177
00:09:07,718 --> 00:09:11,119
Kwa hii, nitaweza kupitia kiangazi hiki bila matatizo.

178
00:09:11,143 --> 00:09:12,720
Ndiyo.

179
00:09:12,743 --> 00:09:16,318
Kutoka kesho tutaendelea kufanya bidii.

180
00:09:16,342 --> 00:09:18,709
Chakula kilikuwa kitamu, asante.

181
00:09:18,732 --> 00:09:21,532
Mwaka ujao nataka nirudi tena.

182
00:09:21,555 --> 00:09:23,055
Sehemu ya 5: Furaha ya Kujiburudisha Kwenye Izakaya

183
00:09:23,055 --> 00:09:27,055
Izakaya za Japani ni za kufurahisha, sivyo?

184
00:09:27,078 --> 00:09:32,678
Ndiyo, kuna chaguo nyingi kwenye menyu, nafanya uchaguzi kuwa mgumu.

185
00:09:32,701 --> 00:09:37,668
Kwanza tuweke agizo kwa vinywaji na edamame.

186
00:09:37,691 --> 00:09:40,024
Edamame?

187
00:09:40,047 --> 00:09:43,580
Hiyo mboga ya kijani kibichi, sivyo?

188
00:09:43,603 --> 00:09:48,642
Ndiyo, inatoka haraka, ni nzuri.

189
00:09:48,665 --> 00:09:51,432
Aa, imefika!

190
00:09:51,455 --> 00:09:54,388
Inatoka kwa haraka sana.

191
00:09:54,411 --> 00:09:57,811
Inaenda vizuri na bia baridi.

192
00:09:57,834 --> 00:10:00,634
Inaonekana tamu sana.

193
00:10:00,657 --> 00:10:03,730
Basi, tutaanza.

194
00:10:03,754 --> 00:10:06,287
Aa, ngoja kidogo.

195
00:10:06,310 --> 00:10:09,409
Usile na ganda.

196
00:10:09,432 --> 00:10:10,704
Eeh?

197
00:10:10,727 --> 00:10:13,861
Je, siwezi kula ganda?

198
00:10:13,884 --> 00:10:19,350
Hapana, ganda ni ngumu, haiwezekani kuliwa.

199
00:10:19,373 --> 00:10:21,753
Sikuwa najua.

200
00:10:21,776 --> 00:10:24,435
Karibu nilikula!

201
00:10:24,459 --> 00:10:29,494
Bonyeza kwa kidole ili kutolea maharagwe ndani.

202
00:10:29,517 --> 00:10:31,372
Kama hivi?

203
00:10:31,395 --> 00:10:34,595
Aa, maharagwe yamepatikana.

204
00:10:34,618 --> 00:10:37,185
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

205
00:10:37,208 --> 00:10:39,008
Una uwezo mkubwa!

206
00:10:39,031 --> 00:10:42,768
Aa, ni tamu sana!

207
00:10:42,792 --> 00:10:46,289
Chumvi iko sawa kabisa, sivyo?

208
00:10:46,313 --> 00:10:47,999
Ndiyo.

209
00:10:48,022 --> 00:10:51,680
Hii inanifanya ninywe bia zaidi.

210
00:10:51,703 --> 00:10:54,705
Haitoki kamwe!

211
00:10:54,729 --> 00:10:57,107
Ndiyo, kweli.

212
00:10:57,130 --> 00:11:00,863
Nimeshamaliza yote!

213
00:11:00,886 --> 00:11:03,944
Je, naomba tena?

214
00:11:03,968 --> 00:11:06,534
Ndiyo, tafadhali.

215
00:11:06,557 --> 00:11:10,624
Mimi nitakata vizuri kwa mara inayofuata.

216
00:11:10,647 --> 00:11:15,981
Kama ni tamu na yenye afya, ninaweza kula tele!

217
00:11:16,005 --> 00:11:19,805
Hii si chakula kinachoonekana sana nchini kwangu.

218
00:11:19,828 --> 00:11:23,161
Inaonekana itakuwa maarufu hata nje ya nchi.

219
00:11:23,184 --> 00:11:24,857
Ndiyo, ni joto sana.

220
00:11:24,881 --> 00:11:28,288
Hii ni utamaduni wa Japani unaopendekezwa.

221
00:11:28,311 --> 00:11:31,386
Nitawafundisha na marafiki zangu.

222
00:11:31,410 --> 00:11:34,543
Usile ganda, basi.

223
00:11:34,566 --> 00:11:38,333
Hiyo ni ushauri muhimu sana.

224
00:11:38,356 --> 00:11:41,689
Tutaagiza nini kwa orodha inayofuata?

225
00:11:41,712 --> 00:11:44,196
Tutaagiza yakitori.

226
00:11:44,220 --> 00:11:46,553
Sawa, nzuri.

227
00:11:46,576 --> 00:11:50,057
Usiku katika izakaya ni bora kabisa.

228
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:51,580
Sehemu ya 6: Mazungumzo ya kuchagua tikiti maji / Kuchagua Tikiti Maji: Mazungumzo

229
00:11:51,580 --> 00:11:54,114
Twende supermarket.

230
00:11:54,137 --> 00:11:55,870
Sawa, nzuri.

231
00:11:55,893 --> 00:11:59,060
Ninataka kununua matunda.

232
00:11:59,083 --> 00:12:02,849
Aa, tikiti maji zipo huko.

233
00:12:02,872 --> 00:12:07,306
Eeh, tikiti maji hii ni kubwa mno!

234
00:12:07,329 --> 00:12:10,495
Inauzwa nzima moja.

235
00:12:10,518 --> 00:12:12,785
Tazama bei yake.

236
00:12:12,809 --> 00:12:15,049
Bei ni ghali mno.

237
00:12:15,073 --> 00:12:18,606
Nchini kwangu ni rahisi zaidi.

238
00:12:18,629 --> 00:12:22,473
Tikiti maji za Japani ni ghali kidogo.

239
00:12:22,496 --> 00:12:26,363
Ni kubwa mno haitingii kwenye jokofu.

240
00:12:26,386 --> 00:12:28,405
Ndiyo, ni joto sana.

241
00:12:28,429 --> 00:12:32,596
Kwa hiyo, tununue tikiti maji ndogo.

242
00:12:32,619 --> 00:12:36,652
Aa, hapa kuna tikiti maji zilizokatwa.

243
00:12:36,675 --> 00:12:41,010
Hizi ni rahisi na zitaingia jokofuni.

244
00:12:41,033 --> 00:12:44,067
Sawa, tununue hizi.

245
00:12:44,090 --> 00:12:46,493
Twende nyumbani tukale.

246
00:12:46,516 --> 00:12:49,949
Sasa, nimeandaa tikiti maji.

247
00:12:49,972 --> 00:12:51,839
Karibu.

248
00:12:51,862 --> 00:12:53,742
Asante.

249
00:12:53,765 --> 00:12:56,011
Inaonekana tamu sana.

250
00:12:56,035 --> 00:12:59,905
Kabla ya kula, weka hii.

251
00:12:59,928 --> 00:13:02,095
Hii ni nini?

252
00:13:02,118 --> 00:13:05,185
Chumvi.

253
00:13:05,209 --> 00:13:07,825
Tunatoa chumvi kwenye tikiti maji.

254
00:13:07,848 --> 00:13:09,082
Eeh?

255
00:13:09,106 --> 00:13:12,883
Unaweka chumvi kwenye tikiti maji?

256
00:13:12,906 --> 00:13:16,597
Tikiti maji ni tamu, sivyo?

257
00:13:16,620 --> 00:13:19,587
Kwa nini unaweka chumvi?

258
00:13:19,610 --> 00:13:24,108
Chumvi huifanya iwe tamu zaidi.

259
00:13:24,131 --> 00:13:26,064
Kweli?

260
00:13:26,087 --> 00:13:28,287
Sisemi kuamini.

261
00:13:28,310 --> 00:13:32,244
Jaribu uone, usifikiri nimeshindwa.

262
00:13:32,267 --> 00:13:34,200
Sawa.

263
00:13:34,223 --> 00:13:37,068
Nitaweka kidogo tu.

264
00:13:37,092 --> 00:13:39,063
Ina ladha gani?

265
00:13:39,086 --> 00:13:42,623
Aa, kweli!

266
00:13:42,646 --> 00:13:45,653
Imekuwa tamu mno!

267
00:13:45,677 --> 00:13:49,210
Ni ajabu, lakini tamu!

268
00:13:49,233 --> 00:13:52,000
Nimefurahi umependea.

269
00:13:52,023 --> 00:13:54,556
Kula tele.

270
00:13:54,579 --> 00:13:56,312
Ndiyo,

271
00:13:56,335 --> 00:14:00,902
Utamaduni wa Japani ni wa kuvutia sana, sivyo?

272
00:14:00,925 --> 00:14:02,425
Mstari wa 7: Utalii wa Kiretro na Jinsi ya Kunywa Ramune / Utalii wa Kale na Kunywa Ramune

273
00:14:02,425 --> 00:14:07,239
Leo tumekuja katika eneo la utalii la kiretro.

274
00:14:07,263 --> 00:14:10,130
Kuna duka la vyakula vya watoto wa kale.

275
00:14:10,153 --> 00:14:11,953
Hebu tuingie.

276
00:14:11,976 --> 00:14:15,670
Aa, wanauza Ramune baridi.

277
00:14:15,693 --> 00:14:17,826
Ramune?

278
00:14:17,849 --> 00:14:21,226
Chupa hii ya kioo ni nzuri sana.

279
00:14:21,250 --> 00:14:22,984
Tununue.

280
00:14:23,007 --> 00:14:25,092
Haya, chukua.

281
00:14:25,116 --> 00:14:26,849
Asante.

282
00:14:26,872 --> 00:14:30,719
Lakini, inanywewaje?

283
00:14:30,742 --> 00:14:33,709
Hakuna kifuniko, sivyo?

284
00:14:33,732 --> 00:14:37,732
Aa, bonyeza kifuniko cha plastiki.

285
00:14:37,755 --> 00:14:39,688
Hiki?

286
00:14:39,711 --> 00:14:44,121
Aa, mpira umeingia ndani.

287
00:14:44,145 --> 00:14:45,982
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

288
00:14:46,005 --> 00:14:50,491
Unapoweka mpira ndani, unaweza kunywa.

289
00:14:50,515 --> 00:14:53,248
Mfumo huu ni wa kuvutia sana.

290
00:14:53,271 --> 00:14:56,604
Basi, tutaanza.

291
00:14:56,627 --> 00:15:00,227
Eeh, juisi haitoki.

292
00:15:00,250 --> 00:15:03,926
Umeilinganisha chupa sana?

293
00:15:03,950 --> 00:15:07,483
Ndiyo, nimeilinganisha sana.

294
00:15:07,506 --> 00:15:09,959
Lakini haitoki.

295
00:15:09,983 --> 00:15:15,881
Aa, mpira umekwama kwenye mdomo wa chupa.

296
00:15:15,904 --> 00:15:19,870
Ni kweli, umekwama.

297
00:15:19,893 --> 00:15:22,227
Nifanyeje sasa?

298
00:15:22,250 --> 00:15:27,666
Kuna sehemu iliyofupika kidogo kwenye mdomo wa chupa.

299
00:15:27,689 --> 00:15:30,456
Sehemu iliyofupika?

300
00:15:30,479 --> 00:15:33,045
Aa, hii ndiyo.

301
00:15:33,068 --> 00:15:36,526
Fungia mpira huko.

302
00:15:36,550 --> 00:15:38,283
Ahaa, nimeelewa.

303
00:15:38,306 --> 00:15:41,515
Nitafungia mpira huko.

304
00:15:41,539 --> 00:15:45,139
Hivyo mpira hautaanguka.

305
00:15:45,162 --> 00:15:47,815
Nitajaribu.

306
00:15:47,838 --> 00:15:50,604
Aa, imetoka!

307
00:15:50,627 --> 00:15:52,903
Umeweza kunywa?

308
00:15:52,927 --> 00:15:55,261
Vizuri sana.

309
00:15:55,284 --> 00:16:00,140
Ndiyo, ni soda tamu sana.

310
00:16:00,163 --> 00:16:05,097
Lakini kunywa ni kidogo ngumu.

311
00:16:05,121 --> 00:16:07,773
Inahitaji ujuzi.

312
00:16:07,796 --> 00:16:10,964
Ukizoea, ni rahisi.

313
00:16:10,988 --> 00:16:15,521
Sauti ya mpira ukipiga chupa ni nzuri.

314
00:16:15,544 --> 00:16:18,559
Ni sauti ya majira ya joto.

315
00:16:18,583 --> 00:16:23,616
Ndiyo, naihisi majira ya joto ya Japani.

316
00:16:23,639 --> 00:16:26,093
Tununue chupa nyingine?

317
00:16:26,117 --> 00:16:28,127
Sawa, nzuri.

318
00:16:28,151 --> 00:16:31,951
Ninafikiri nitakunywa vizuri zaidi wakati ujao.

319
00:16:31,974 --> 00:16:33,474
Mstari wa 8: Kula Chakula cha Samaki Hamo Kwenye Mto Wakati wa Majira ya Joto / Kula Hamo Kwenye Maji ya Mto: Furahia Hamo wakati wa Majira ya Joto

320
00:16:33,474 --> 00:16:37,725
Majira ya joto huko Kyoto ni ya joto sana, sivyo?

321
00:16:37,748 --> 00:16:39,882
Ndiyo, ni joto sana.

322
00:16:39,905 --> 00:16:43,842
Lakini hapa ni baridi.

323
00:16:43,865 --> 00:16:48,799
Ndiyo, duka liko juu ya mto.

324
00:16:48,822 --> 00:16:52,756
Hii inaitwa 'kawadoko'.

325
00:16:52,779 --> 00:16:57,272
Unaweza kuona maji ya mto, ni ya kupendeza sana.

326
00:16:57,296 --> 00:17:00,496
Upepo unaoza vizuri sana.

327
00:17:00,518 --> 00:17:04,328
Sasa, chakula kimefika.

328
00:17:04,352 --> 00:17:07,685
Samaki mweupe mzuri sana, sivyo?

329
00:17:07,708 --> 00:17:10,042
Hii ni nini?

330
00:17:10,065 --> 00:17:14,031
Hii ni samaki aitwaye Hamo.

331
00:17:14,054 --> 00:17:17,621
Ni samaki ya kiwango cha juu kwa majira ya joto.

332
00:17:17,644 --> 00:17:19,244
Hamo?

333
00:17:19,267 --> 00:17:22,000
Sijawahi kusikia jina hilo.

334
00:17:22,023 --> 00:17:26,657
Wameipika kwa kuipita katika maji ya moto, huitwa 'yubiki'.

335
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:30,046
Tafadhali ongeza sauce ya ume na ule.

336
00:17:30,069 --> 00:17:32,313
Inaonekana tamu sana.

337
00:17:32,337 --> 00:17:34,138
Tunakula.

338
00:17:34,162 --> 00:17:39,295
Je, samaki hii haina mifupa?

339
00:17:39,318 --> 00:17:43,751
Hapana, kwa kweli ina mifupa mingi sana.

340
00:17:43,774 --> 00:17:48,647
Eeh, ina mifupa mingi?

341
00:17:48,671 --> 00:17:50,071
Ndiyo.

342
00:17:50,094 --> 00:17:53,694
Lakini usijali.

343
00:17:53,717 --> 00:17:59,484
Wataalamu wamekatakata mifupa kwa kushika kisu vizuri.

344
00:17:59,507 --> 00:18:02,313
Wamekatakata mifupa?

345
00:18:02,336 --> 00:18:03,993
Ndiyo.

346
00:18:04,016 --> 00:18:08,550
Ni ujuzi maalum uitwao 'kukata mifupa'.

347
00:18:08,573 --> 00:18:13,706
Kwa hiyo, hata kama kuna mifupa, unaweza kula bila matatizo.

348
00:18:13,729 --> 00:18:16,496
Ujuzi wa ajabu sana!

349
00:18:16,518 --> 00:18:19,165
Sasa nitakula.

350
00:18:19,189 --> 00:18:23,859
Waa, ni laini mno!

351
00:18:23,883 --> 00:18:27,250
Mifupa haijawahi kunikera.

352
00:18:27,273 --> 00:18:29,113
Vizuri sana.

353
00:18:29,136 --> 00:18:32,469
Sauce ya ume inalingana nayo vizuri.

354
00:18:32,492 --> 00:18:34,026
Ndiyo.

355
00:18:34,048 --> 00:18:38,382
Ni tamu na yenye kuvutia, na ni tamu sana!

356
00:18:38,405 --> 00:18:41,571
Samaki hii inafaa sana kwa majira ya joto.

357
00:18:41,594 --> 00:18:46,330
Nimejifunza sana kuhusu utamaduni wa Kyoto.

358
00:18:46,354 --> 00:18:51,187
Mazingira ni mazuri, na chakula ni bora kabisa.

359
00:18:51,210 --> 00:18:54,879
Asante kwa kunileta hapa.

360
00:18:54,902 --> 00:19:00,469
Hapana, bado kuna chakula kingine kitamu.

361
00:19:00,492 --> 00:19:02,459
Ninangojea kwa hamu.

362
00:19:02,482 --> 00:19:05,316
Tutakula polepole.

363
00:19:05,339 --> 00:19:06,839
Sehemu ya 9: Kukutana kwa bahati mbaya katika mgahawa / Mkutaniko usiotarajiwa katika Mgahawa

364
00:19:06,839 --> 00:19:11,639
Tumepiga hatua nyingi katika joto hili.

365
00:19:11,662 --> 00:19:15,906
Ndio, koo yangu limekauka sana.

366
00:19:15,930 --> 00:19:19,063
Haya, tuingie katika mgahawa huu wa vyakula vya mseto.

367
00:19:19,086 --> 00:19:21,102
Sawa, nzuri.

368
00:19:21,126 --> 00:19:23,340
Ni baridi hapa.

369
00:19:23,363 --> 00:19:26,763
Aa, chai imefika.

370
00:19:26,786 --> 00:19:31,052
Waa, ni kinywaji baridi!

371
00:19:31,075 --> 00:19:34,209
Rangi yake ni ya kahawia.

372
00:19:34,232 --> 00:19:39,466
Bahati nzuri, wamenipa kahawa ya baridi bure.

373
00:19:39,489 --> 00:19:43,059
Eeh, kahawa ya baridi?

374
00:19:43,083 --> 00:19:49,416
Ndio, nchini kwangu rangi hii ni ya kahawa.

375
00:19:49,439 --> 00:19:51,773
Nitakula sasa—naam!

376
00:19:51,796 --> 00:19:55,196
Glugluglu...

377
00:19:55,219 --> 00:19:56,425
Eh?

378
00:19:56,449 --> 00:19:59,908
Lakini ladha yake ni tofauti kabisa.

379
00:19:59,931 --> 00:20:02,131
Je, si chungu?

380
00:20:02,154 --> 00:20:04,355
Je, si tamu?

381
00:20:04,378 --> 00:20:09,391
Hapana, si chungu wala si tamu.

382
00:20:09,415 --> 00:20:12,262
Hii si kahawa.

383
00:20:12,285 --> 00:20:15,918
Hii ni chai inayoitwa mugicha.

384
00:20:15,941 --> 00:20:20,708
Katika mikahawa ya Kijapani, wakati wa joto wanaipea wateja mara nyingi.

385
00:20:20,731 --> 00:20:23,664
Unaweza kunywa bure.

386
00:20:23,687 --> 00:20:27,257
Bure ni jambo la furaha sana!

387
00:20:27,281 --> 00:20:29,287
Je, ni chai ya shayiri?

388
00:20:29,310 --> 00:20:32,110
Nimekunywa kwa mara ya kwanza.

389
00:20:32,133 --> 00:20:35,975
Inafurahisha na kunywa kwa baridi inatuliza koo.

390
00:20:35,998 --> 00:20:40,198
Haikali kafeini, kwa hiyo ni nzuri kwa afya.

391
00:20:40,221 --> 00:20:42,622
Ndiyo hivyo!

392
00:20:42,645 --> 00:20:45,979
Inanyweka vizuri sana.

393
00:20:46,002 --> 00:20:51,301
Nilitaka kunywa kahawa baridi, lakini hii pia ni nzuri.

394
00:20:51,324 --> 00:20:53,757
Je, umependea?

395
00:20:53,780 --> 00:20:55,747
Nimependea sana.

396
00:20:55,770 --> 00:21:00,570
Kuna barafu nyingi, na inafaa kwa baridi sana.

397
00:21:00,593 --> 00:21:04,593
Samahani, naomba nyongeza tafadhali.

398
00:21:04,616 --> 00:21:07,470
Nyweshe kwa wingi!

399
00:21:07,493 --> 00:21:08,826
Ndiyo.

400
00:21:08,849 --> 00:21:13,493
Wakati wa joto nchini Japani, chai ya shayiri ni lazima.

401
00:21:13,516 --> 00:21:16,749
Sasa, tuagize chakula.

402
00:21:16,772 --> 00:21:19,106
Utakula nini?

403
00:21:19,129 --> 00:21:22,411
Ninataka kula udon baridi.

404
00:21:22,434 --> 00:21:23,934
Mstari wa 10: Karibu Kwenye Siku ya Joto Kubwa na Karai Kali

405
00:21:23,934 --> 00:21:29,074
Leo ni siku ya joto kali sana!

406
00:21:29,097 --> 00:21:33,830
Jua linachoma mno, naona kama nitaeleka!

407
00:21:33,853 --> 00:21:37,747
Siku kama hizi, twende dukani hii.

408
00:21:37,771 --> 00:21:40,138
Duka la karai?

409
00:21:40,161 --> 00:21:43,197
Inanukia vizuri sana!

410
00:21:43,221 --> 00:21:48,089
Ndiyo, karai kali hapa inajulikana sana.

411
00:21:48,112 --> 00:21:51,245
Eeh, karai kali?

412
00:21:51,268 --> 00:21:54,035
Karai hii nyekundu sana!

413
00:21:54,058 --> 00:21:57,946
Ndiyo, inachoma sana!

414
00:21:57,970 --> 00:22:00,349
Subiri kidogo.

415
00:22:00,373 --> 00:22:04,307
Siku yenye joto kama hii!

416
00:22:04,330 --> 00:22:08,530
Kwa nini kula kitu kinachowasha na kichochoro katika siku ya joto hivi?

417
00:22:08,553 --> 00:22:11,529
Itakuwa joto zaidi!

418
00:22:11,552 --> 00:22:16,430
Kula kitu kinachowasha kunasababisha jasho nyingi.

419
00:22:16,454 --> 00:22:22,221
Jasho linapotoka, mwili huwa baridi baadaye.

420
00:22:22,244 --> 00:22:27,584
Nchini Japani, watu wengi hula vitu vya kuchoma wakati wa joto.

421
00:22:27,607 --> 00:22:30,376
Hutoa nguvu!

422
00:22:30,399 --> 00:22:32,566
Kweli?

423
00:22:32,589 --> 00:22:35,122
Inaonekana kama uongo!

424
00:22:35,145 --> 00:22:37,745
Lakini, nimeelewa.

425
00:22:37,768 --> 00:22:39,972
Nitajaribu.

426
00:22:39,996 --> 00:22:42,573
Karai imekuja!

427
00:22:42,596 --> 00:22:44,396
Karibu.

428
00:22:44,419 --> 00:22:49,352
Eeh, harufu pekee inanifanya nijishe jasho!

429
00:22:49,375 --> 00:22:51,508
Tunakula.

430
00:22:51,531 --> 00:22:55,098
I-i, inachoma mno!

431
00:22:55,121 --> 00:22:57,354
Tafadhali, maji.

432
00:22:57,377 --> 00:22:59,990
U-u, uko sawa?

433
00:23:00,014 --> 00:23:03,814
Hata kunywa maji, bado inachoma.

434
00:23:03,837 --> 00:23:06,837
Kinywa kinaniuma.

435
00:23:06,860 --> 00:23:10,661
Lakini, sipati nafasi ya kuacha kijiko.

436
00:23:10,684 --> 00:23:12,451
Ndiyo.

437
00:23:12,474 --> 00:23:15,074
Inachoma!

438
00:23:15,097 --> 00:23:19,064
Lakini, ni tamu sana.

439
00:23:19,087 --> 00:23:22,253
Ina ladha nzuri!

440
00:23:22,276 --> 00:23:25,876
Jumbe zinatoa damu kutoka kwenye paji la uso.

441
00:23:25,899 --> 00:23:28,466
Inasikika vizuri, sivyo?

442
00:23:28,489 --> 00:23:30,226
Ndiyo.

443
00:23:30,250 --> 00:23:34,135
Kwa ajabu, ninaanza kuhisi furaha.

444
00:23:34,159 --> 00:23:39,434
Ona, ukitoka nje ya duka, unaona baridi kidogo.

445
00:23:39,457 --> 00:23:41,702
Ndiyo, kweli.

446
00:23:41,726 --> 00:23:45,328
Ninaona si moto kama ilivyokuwa awali.

447
00:23:45,351 --> 00:23:49,370
Karibu ya chumvi kali ya kiangazi, ni bora kabisa!

448
00:23:49,394 --> 00:23:51,401
Ndiyo.

449
00:23:51,424 --> 00:23:54,791
Inaweza kukutia uraibu.

450
00:23:54,814 --> 00:23:57,092
Tutakuja tena.